Update from bigquery-adbc releases

This distribution's `system update` only said to update dbt-core with a package manager, which would
install stock dbt. It now runs the install script of bigquery-adbc's latest release, with the same
`--prefix` or `--to` location that dbt Labs' distribution passes to its own installer. That script
does not support Windows, so Windows still refuses. The command is no longer hidden.

